Subject: [PATCH] import time for Kubernetes watch reconnect sleep
Source: https://github.com/NVIDIA/k8s-cc-manager/blob/v0.4.1/main.py#L684

Upstream v0.4.1 calls time.sleep(5) after a Kubernetes API exception but does
not import time, turning the reconnect path into a NameError. Keep the pinned
release functional until the fix is available in an upstream release.

--- a/main.py
+++ b/main.py
@@ -25,5 +25,6 @@ import argparse
 import logging
 import os
 import sys
+import time
 from pathlib import Path
